# There is no Bindings.xml, and adding one back is a decision rather than a detail. Chronie
# photographs by listening for SCREENSHOT_SUCCEEDED, which the client fires for the
# screenshot key every player already has bound, so a key of its own would be a second way
# to do the one thing — and the file was its own recurring bug: the client loads it by name
# before it reads this manifest, so naming it here parsed it twice as UI XML (issue #44),
# and a header declared on more than one binding was reported as loaded twice (issue #69).
